{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"Kubernetes.kwok","latestVersion":"0.8.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"A toolkit that enables setting up a cluster of thousands of Nodes in seconds.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kwok/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"A toolkit that enables setting up a cluster of thousands of Nodes in seconds.","license":"Apache-2.0","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kwok/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"KWOK is a toolkit that enables setting up a cluster of thousands of Nodes in seconds. Under the scene, all Nodes are simulated to behave like real ones, so the overall approach employs a pretty low resource footprint that you can easily play around on your laptop.","moniker":"kwok","name":"kwok","packageUrl":"https://kwok.sigs.k8s.io/","publisher":"Kubernetes SIGs","publisherUrl":"https://kubernetes.io/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kwok/releases/tag/v0.8.0","tags":["cluster","container","docker","k8s","kubernetes"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"可在数秒内建立由数千个节点组成的集群的工具包。","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"KWOK 是一个工具包，可在数秒内建立由数千个节点组成的集群。在内部，所有节点的行为都是模拟的，与真实节点无异，因此整个方法占用的资源非常少，你可以在笔记本电脑上轻松玩转。","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kwok/releases/tag/v0.8.0","tags":["docker","k8s","kubernetes","容器","集群"]}},"longDescription":"KWOK is a toolkit that enables setting up a cluster of thousands of Nodes in seconds. Under the scene, all Nodes are simulated to behave like real ones, so the overall approach employs a pretty low resource footprint that you can easily play around on your laptop.","moniker":"kwok","name":"kwok","packageUrl":"https://kwok.sigs.k8s.io/","publisher":"Kubernetes SIGs","publisherUrl":"https://kubernetes.io/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kwok/releases/tag/v0.8.0","tags":["cluster","container","docker","k8s","kubernete